<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:42:02.783Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>UPDATE SET Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SQL</keyword>
    <keyword>UPDATE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">UPDATE Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">使用 SQL 语法更新表中记录的字段。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">UPDATE &lt;TableName&gt; SET &lt;FieldName1&gt; = &lt;eExpression1&gt; [, &lt;FieldName2&gt; = &lt;eExpression2&gt; ...] [WHERE &lt;lCondition&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;TableName&gt;<tab />必须更新的表（或别名）。该表必须处于打开状态。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">SET &lt;FieldName&gt; = &lt;eExpression&gt;<tab />待更新的字段及其新值。对于每个满足条件的记录，都会对其表达式进行求值。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">WHERE &lt;lCondition&gt;<tab />仅更新满足该条件的记录。若省略此子句，则更新所有记录。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">记录在更新期间（如有必要）会被锁定，更新完成后解锁。此命令与 xBase 的 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_UPDATE">UPDATE</link> 命令不同。</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Body Text" style="font-weight:bold; color:#ff0000;">目前不支持</text>：包含 JOIN 或子查询的 UPDATE 语句。使用此类语句时，编译器会报错。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Examples</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example">UPDATE Customers SET Country = &quot;NL&quot;, Active = .T. WHERE City == &quot;Amsterdam&quot;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_REPLACE">REPLACE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_INSERT_INTO">INSERT INTO</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_DELETE_FROM">DELETE FROM</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
